    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cCut-Out Your Imagination!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutout World: Create Your Own Interactive Shorts Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Cutout World, an innovative service that allows anyone to easily create short video clips, or 'shorts,' and transform them into interactive video content! Dive into a world where your imagination becomes the stage for captivating stories and immersive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061040/extras/dc9300273a655dc33ddc8d3ab1169302.avif?t=1753882679\" data-has-big width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly place NPCs with intuitive in-game tools.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061040/extras/9df41a50bc4b728bca96241d76b19710.avif?t=1753882679\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unlimited creative freedom with rich background assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061040/extras/3b39e4e1d316173e00037497f9f8bc08.avif?t=1753882679\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cCut-Out Your Imagination!\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutout World: Create Your Own Interactive Shorts Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Cutout World, an innovative service that allows anyone to easily create short video clips, or 'shorts,' and transform them into interactive video content! Dive into a world where your imagination becomes the stage for captivating stories and immersive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061040/extras/dc9300273a655dc33ddc8d3ab1169302.avif?t=1753882679\" data-has-big width=800 height=269 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Effortlessly place NPCs with intuitive in-game tools.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061040/extras/9df41a50bc4b728bca96241d76b19710.avif?t=1753882679\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unlimited creative freedom with rich background assets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3061040/extras/3b39e4e1d316173e00037497f9f8bc08.avif?t=1753882679\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
